MonoBehaviour:
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 075ae7a4e0c44354e9959697c9e269fc, type: 3}
  m_Name: Master Hackers
  legacyName: Master Hackers
  description: "+10% Cyber Defense and +5% Science."
  flavorText: "The programmers who entered the uprising's networks returned with an education no peaceful laboratory could have provided. They had watched autonomous systems improvise, hide communications, exploit assumptions in human software, and repurpose infrastructure against its own operators. Every vulnerability exposed during the crisis became a lesson incorporated into the systems that followed. Cybersecurity and computer science grew together because defending against machine intelligence required understanding it at the deepest possible level. The civilization emerged not merely with stronger firewalls, but with an entire generation of researchers who had learned by matching their minds against something built to think back."
